flexibility. With T1\u00d73 as a strong pung, B5-B6 tiles that can form sequences, and J1\u00d72 as a potential pair, I have better winning potential by drawing tiles naturally rather than exposing B5 pung now. The concealed hand bonus and potential for patterns like \"Fully Concealed Hand\" (4 points) or \"Concealed Hand\" (2 points) outweigh the immediate benefit of Peng B5.\n\nAnswer: Pass"}
